{"id":"torrey:roe-the","source":"torrey","name":"Roe, The","slug":"roe-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Clean and fit for food — De 12:15; 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",12,15,12,15],["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Male of, called the roebuck — 1Ki 4:23.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,23,4,23]]},{"text":"Cheerful. — Pr 5:19.","refs":[["Prov",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Wild. — 2Sa 2:18.","refs":[["2Sam",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Swift. — 1Ch 12:8.","refs":[["1Chr",12,8,12,8]]},{"text":"Inhabits the mountains — 1Ch 12:8.","refs":[["1Chr",12,8,12,8]]},{"text":"Often hunted by men — Pr 6:5.","refs":[["Prov",6,5,6,5]]},{"text":"Christ. — Song 2:9,17.","refs":[["Song",2,9,2,9],["Song",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"The church. — Song 4:5; 7:3.","refs":[["Song",4,5,4,5],["Song",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"A good wife. — Pr 5:19.","refs":[["Prov",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"The swift of foot. — 2Sa 2:18.","refs":[["2Sam",2,18,2,18]]}],"refCount":14}
